WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.610
The furious rain, Makes my heart shake
hageshii ame ga, kokoro wo yuruwaseru

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.820
Like it did on that day
Ano hi no youni

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.910
But I just ran through, In my dream I had till yesterday
Tada hashirinuketa, kinou made no MY DREAM

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
...I still believe
...shinjiteiru no sa

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm willing to fight, An endless defense
Owari no nai, defense demo ii yo

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.350
As long as you, Keep on gazing at me
Kimi ga boku wo, mitsumetsuzukete kureru nara

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.270
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
Turn to face all the mornings ahead, And someday
Ikutsumono asa wo mukae, Itsuka kitto

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
Try to seize them
tsukande miseru

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.450
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:02.120
Even if nothing, Lies on the other side
Sono mukougawa ni, nanimonakutemo

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
It doesn't matter to me
kamawanai kara

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:14.050
...Just as long as I can embrace, Your gentle, irreplaceable smile!
Kakegae no nai, kimi no yasashii egao daite

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.700
Mankind, having polluted the whole of Earth,

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.200
even after ushering in an era of space colonization,

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:35.000
just as it had on Earth, repeated its history of war.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:42.360
Some wanted to believe it was caused by their instincts...

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:46.130
...as they tried to adapt to a new environment.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:59.660
Because Üso's went to the Uwig special quarter that night,

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:05.930
Marbet and Miss Katejina made him dock that white "Victory" mobile suit here.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.130
Üso! Go ahead and dock it! Do you read me?

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:21.330
Even Karlmann here is on my back now because Üso went to Uwig.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:26.260
But he saw terrifying things in that city.

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:28.230
It changed him.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.130
ÜSO'S BATTLE

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.500
"Üso's Battle".
ÜSO'S BATTLE

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.030
ÜSO'S BATTLE

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.500
Where can we run?!

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.900
All the city's exits have been destroyed!

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:37.830
Mommy!

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:39.860
Hurry, before we suffocate!

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.260
The north side's roads are gone!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.000
This way! This way!

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:45.860
Vivian!

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:47.060
Daddy! Daddy!

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:48.300
Where do we go?!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.960
The whole city's on fire!

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.360
What do they hope to achieve by destroying it?!

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:09.260
Another new model.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.930
That's not an attack formation.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:20.100
Looks like there's about four of them.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:22.930
What's going on?

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:27.700
Don't stop! Just run!

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:39.360
Why would they do this? Why?!

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.400
I'm being shot at?!

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.930
Let him have it with the wire-guided missiles!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.660
I won't let a single BESPA soldier set foot in this city!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.330
You're not getting away!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.260
Die! Die! Die!

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.730
No! You've got it all wrong! I'm not with BESPA!

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:02.830
You can't murder people as you please!

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.600
Kill that hunter pilot!

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:08.560
I'm not from BESPA! I'm not a Yellow Jacket!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.730
Incoming from the rear!

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.230
Ltjg. Cronicle!

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:26.900
Even with the Minovsky particles, you should still read me at this range.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.960
Ltjg. Cronicle, are you all right?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.630
How could you do this?!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.560
How could you burn the city and kill all these people?!

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.100
Can't you hear me?

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.530
Who's in there?

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:46.260
I can't use the beam rifle without blowing up his fusion engine!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.800
Is he trying to surrender?

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:52.330
Point your rifle's barrel into the air!

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:53.630
Isn't there anything else?

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:56.160
Just the beam sabers?

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.760
H-He's using the test unit?!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.000
Leave!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.560
I don't know what the Shokew's abilities are!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.360
Bottom Terminal, come!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.030
What?!

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:25.700
The machine I saw before!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.830
What? What's he doing?

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.100
It became a mobile suit!

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.630
If I defeat the one who took the Shokew from Ltjg. Cronicle,

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:57.200
it'll be quite a feather in my cap!

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.900
The enemy... Fighting amongst themselves?

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.430
Whatever the reason...

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.100
Come here!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:19.100
Victory for the League Militaire!

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:23.330
What?!

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:33.330
Where's the Shokew?!

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:36.830
No! It can't have been destroyed.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.700
He's my prey!

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.700
Miss Katejina's house should be around here.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.300
Where's Miss Katejina Loos?

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.630
Please tell me where she is! Miss Katejina Loos?

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.330
Why is he looking for my house?

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:00.460
Katejina!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.100
It's lucky we didn't lose our heads and run.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:06.460
How could that boy Üso have known this would happen tonight?

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.400
Katejina, where are you?

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.460
We might live through this after all.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:11.760
What do you mean?

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.130
BESPA is going to protect us.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.760
I don't believe that! Why?

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:20.800
When I figured the Earth Federation Forces would abandon this city,

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:26.160
I struck a deal with Zanscare's BESPA forces.

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:29.960
The Yellow Jackets are the cruelest of BESPA's forces.

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:33.130
They're massacring the city's populace!

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:35.160
It's not a massacre.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:38.600
They're just trying to drive out the League Militaire resistance.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.400
Can't you see that's a lie?!

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:44.430
This is the fault of the resistance for burrowing into our city!

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.100
And it's fine with you, as long as we're safe?!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:51.630
I was forced to cut a deal with them to save you and your mother!

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:55.700
Do you even know where Mother's been for the past two or three days?!

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:56.730
Shut up!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.530
No, I... I didn't mean to...

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:05.600
Katejina!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.530
Run! Run! Run!

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.800
I'll find you, wherever you go!

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.200
If we complete our mobile suit now...

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.200
Aren't you able to help everyone?!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.060
The timing's bad.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:31.230
Yeah, she's right.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:45.400
Lieutenant! Aren't you one of us?!

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:46.760
They're civilians!

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:50.400
Just townsfolk! They're not fighting a war!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:22.300
I won't let you turn the Earth into a Zanscare resort!

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.260
He's dead... Hm?

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:27.730
Who are you?!

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.600
Üso, sick! Sick!

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.530
There's a kid inside! What's going on here?!

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.400
A kid's inside it?

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.930
The Zanscare Empire is using the guillotine...

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.760
...to make us surrender through force of terror!

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:50.400
But as our comrades in the space colonies continue to cause strife,

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:53.660
the Earth Federation Government is sure to rescue us!

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.360
If we hang on, the colonies outside of the Zanscare will send help!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.500
Until then, we must keep on fighting!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.100
He's right! Let's keep it up!

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:04.260
You're awake?

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.500
Miss Katejina!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.360
Thank goodness. You seem fine.

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.500
Are you all right, Miss Katejina?

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:19.830
So... They said you were piloting a mobile suit.

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:22.460
It was by chance. A coincidence.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.130
They say that boy saved this baby.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.330
Yes, he was very brave.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.060
What'll we do?

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:32.600
We're safe here!

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:33.830
Don't panic! We're safe here!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.360
Are they going to open fire on us?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:35.960
Calm down!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.800
Don't panic! Panicking will just get us killed!

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.960
Chris was killed around here! Which means...

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:48.300
The League Militaire's underground factory must be around here!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.130
That's the only reason I can think of!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:51.930
Blast everything!

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.660
W-Who's there?

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:50.700
Ensign Garry Tunn?

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.930
Ltjg. Cronicle! Are you all right?

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:00.130
I wasn't planning to die in this place.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:04.260
It's all your fault I was...

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.430
You're barely standing. Don't strain yourself.

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:13.260
Seeing how you abandoned me yesterday,

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.360
I'm the one who should be angry.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:17.530
That's why I...

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.230
Friendly units.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:20.460
Sabat and the others.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.630
That's a friendly flare!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.230
Are Cronicle and Ensign Garry still alive?

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:42.400
Is anybody still here?

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:46.160
A baby crying...

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.930
I can't hear anything.

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:48.960
Miss Katejina?

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.930
The air's getting thin in here, don't you think?

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:54.830
That can't be!

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:56.660
What do we do?

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:07.060
There's air coming through here.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.060
Miss Kate- Ow!

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:13.960
Come on, don't cry.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:17.460
There, there...

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:23.560
There's an opening leading down. It's gonna kick up some dust.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.360
What is that?

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:46.130
Looks like a subway sign from the pre-UC era.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:49.430
A subway! A subway!

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:05.300
Since you're scheduled to return to Zanscare after the tests are complete,

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:07.800
then you should follow the schedule and go home.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:13.860
Tell your sister that Fuala looks forward to the day she can see her again.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.800
Sabat and the others returned without retrieving the Shokew!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:22.500
I'm sending them out again to deal with both that...

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:24.530
...and the little fighter you spotted.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:25.760
I see.

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:31.960
We'll never win any glory for ourselves in this backwater!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.130
This unit's still safe.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.160
Please, don't worry. Climb aboard.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:49.130
What kind of child are you?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:52.600
One of the illegal Earth immigrants you hate, right, Miss Katejina?

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.930
Let's go, before there's a second wave or a reconnaissance flight.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:59.600
Y-You're right. Please do. Don't drop us, okay?

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:00.230
Sure thing.

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:03.700
How is it?

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.730
Okay, just go slow.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:07.400
Right.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:12.530
Here we go.

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:13.260
Haro!

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:36.030
My house was destroyed, and I have no idea what happened to my father.

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:39.830
Mother went out for a walk two or three days ago...

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:43.160
She probably left to meet a man outside of Uwig.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:50.460
Üso!

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:51.800
Shahkti! Don't go!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.430
That doesn't sound like the mobile suit Üso was piloting!

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:56.060
Wait! Shahkti!

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.000
You guys, stay there! Don't move!

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:02.600
Otis, they're Yellow Jacket Zolos!

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:03.300
Zolos?

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:04.060
How many? Zolos?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.460
What are kids doing here?

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:19.960
If they're illegals living in this area, they must know what happened yesterday.

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:21.160
Go question them.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.130
Roger!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.830
We won't hurt you! Just let us talk!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.430
We can't let them see us!

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:32.130
Stop! Stop, or I really will shoot!

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.400
What?! What do you want with us?!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:49.230
Those units I saw flying towards Kasarelia are called Zolos?

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:51.600
This is no joke!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.430
What's wrong? Are we there?

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.330
Please wait here for a bit.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:01.200
It looks like we need to be careful approaching Kasarelia.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:02.700
The enemy's there?

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:03.660
I don't know.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:05.630
Don't move from here.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.130
Don't do anything reckless, Üso!

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.760
There's no way I would.

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.700
Ha! You're illegal immigrants, anyway.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.560
Ensign Sabat! I've picked up a mobile suit!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:20.230
What?

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.830
The Shokew! It looks like the test unit!

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.160
It's headed this way!

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.660
I thought it was destroyed in Uwig! Which way?

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:28.560
Run!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.500
Don't you touch that girl!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.160
The Shokew's still functional?!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:44.430
What?!

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:48.700
Run! Just run!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.560
Kasarelia is our land!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.630
Get out!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:05.560
Why, you!

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:10.000
Don't mess with us!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:15.930
Is that Üso fighting them?

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.500
Trying to run?!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:32.530
They're fighting amongst themselves?

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:36.560
But didn't that Shokew fly here from Uwig?

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:41.200
Then, that boy Üso is probably piloting it.

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:46.530
I see... Although I'd like to think that was impossible.

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:50.330
You're the one who did that to Garry!

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.400
It'll take more than that!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:18:59.060
Haro!

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.700
What are you standing there for?! Do something to help him!

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:08.430
Üso! Please, help Üso!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:11.260
You're saying Üso is in that Shokew?

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:14.830
Why else would the Yellow Jackets be fighting each other?!

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:16.800
What are you doing, Marbet?

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:19.060
We can use the Top Limb's rifle.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:26.100
If it's being used by the resistance, I'll rip that machine apart!

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:29.460
If I use the beam sabers like bullets...

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:40.100
Marbet, stop!

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.860
Face our rear towards the river!

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:43.730
R-Right!

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:45.660
Increasing trajectory angle!

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.130
Otis! Got it?

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.130
What's their bearing?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.230
Just hold it!

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.260
Wait a sec.

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:54.960
One shot, and then we move.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.860
Since we can't let them find us.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:58.230
I don't see them!

00:19:58.260 --> 00:19:59.560
No, here they come!

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:04.660
They're not letting me get near them!

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:09.160
I don't want to blow up with him!

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:13.200
Cut off his limbs with your saber and we'll just take the engine back!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.400
Exactly! And I'll kill the pilot!

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.060
What?!

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:31.400
A ground emplacement, here?!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:32.460
Lemme go!

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.260
A ground emplacement?

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:46.230
The mobile suit... It's falling.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:53.960
Lee! Come in! If you can hear me, respond! Lee!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.130
Why can't I release the dock?!

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:07.360
Guess Lady Luck is still with me.

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:21.960
This lady was bombed in Uwig.

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:24.560
I'm glad you made it out.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:25.260
Thanks.

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.700
Üso, you're really moving up in the world.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:30.500
Only thanks to the Shokew.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.830
Thanks for the cover fire, before.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:38.830
No, I'm sorry we couldn't do more for you.

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:42.500
We need to get this baby some milk and diapers.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:46.030
Yeah. If you'd be so kind...

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:49.830
You should be glad you didn't end up facing the guillotine.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:55.030
Üso, what'll we do now?

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:11.100
There, there. I'll make some milk for you.

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:29.530
Piercing the sky, Blue lightning
sora wo tsukisasu aoi inazuma

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:35.320
Staining the earth, With the shadow of greed
daichi o someteku, yokubou no kage

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.460
Once again, when the nightmare, Envelops the Earth
futatabi akumu ga, sekai wo tsutsumu toki

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.790
You hear voices crying out "S.O.S."
"SOS" wo sakebu koe ga kikoeru...

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:54.130
Let proud hope fill your heart
hokoritakaki kibou wo mune ni

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.100
And stand up! Say a prayer for peace!!
tachiagare! heiwa no inori komete!

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.100
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.980
In every age
itsuno jidai mo

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:14.570
...People take risks for freedom
hito wa jiyuu wo kakete

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.240
The battle goes on
tatakai tsuzukeru

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.920
Fighting all alone in solitude
kodoku na made ni hitori...

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:36.130
The Yellow Jackets target the Camion for attack.

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:39.230
We see that they're planning to attack Kasarelia.

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:42.760
Üso continues his desperate battle.

00:23:43.330 --> 00:23:48.260
In the depths of terror, Üso hears a person's cry.

00:23:50.060 --> 00:23:53.060
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:54.260 --> 00:23:55.860
Next Episode FOR WHOM DO WE FIGHT?
"For Whom Do We Fight?"

00:23:55.860 --> 00:23:57.030
Please watch it!
